Slash'EM may have created an emergency save file. These are named with a
".e" suffix to prevent users continuing the game without intervention from
the game admin. If you can find your save directory, take a look to see if
such a file is there. If it is then copy the file to the same name without
the ".e" suffix and try it. If all goes well, then remove the emergency
save file.

